"transfer to suspense", "D": "allotment of budget grants"}, "answer": "A", "i": "q1hhaybp5ifl"}, {"q": "Interest paid on railway borrowings is debited to", "options": {"A": "Capital account", "B": "Revenue account", "C": "Block account", "D": "Suspense account"}, "answer": "B", "i": "qkf4n1svo12"}, {"q": "Track maintenance expenditure is charged to", "options": {"A": "Development Fund", "B": "Capital", "C": "Revenue", "D": "DRF"}, "answer": "C", "i": "q1cl3s7w9epl"}, {"q": "A new line project is financed from", "options": {"A": "suspense", "B": "deposit", "C": "revenue", "D": "capital"}, "answer": "D", "i": "qx4pgmdhf4s"}, {"q": "Net surplus of Railways represents", "options": {"A": "net revenue after meeting obligations", "B": "capital-at-charge", "C": "budget grant", "D": "gross earnings"}, "answer": "A", "i": "q1qx435tf977"}, {"q": "Losses on strategic lines are borne on", "options": {"A": "capital", "B": "revenue", "C": "block", "D": "loan"}, "answer": "B", "i": "q1ag0hdprdxv"}, {"q": "Sources of finance for capital expenditure include", "options": {"A": "staff deposits", "B": "current earnings only", "C": "capital, loans and earmarked funds", "D": "suspense"}, "answer": "C", "i": "q1v1m4bnhy1u"}, {"q": "Pensionary charges are debited to", "options": {"A": "Block account", "B": "Suspense account", "C": "Capital account", "D": "Revenue account"}, "answer": "D", "i": "q162q6gcjvk2"}, {"q": "Revenue expenditure is that which", "options": {"A": "is consumed in operations", "B": "is kept in suspense", "C": "increases capital-at-charge", "D": "creates new assets"}, "answer": "A", "i": "qjvdq5xnyys"}, {"q": "Examples of capital receipts are", "options": {"A": "traffic earnings", "B": "loans and sale proceeds of assets", "C": "sundry income", "D": "refunds"}, "answer": "B", "i": "q113gzw9tv5z"}, {"q": "The chief source of railway revenue is", "options": {"A": "sale of land", "B": "loans", "C": "gross traffic receipts", "D": "deposits"}, "answer": "C", "i": "q1sxyqbeav94"}, {"q": "The purpose of charging renewals to DRF is", "options": {"A": "reducing dividend", "B": "increasing suspense", "C": "inflating revenue", "D": "replacing assets without fresh capital"}, "answer": "D", "i": "q5nrw4pmm4a"}, {"q": "The revenue account of Railways is", "options": {"A": "closed annually", "B": "closed every five years", "C": "closed on demand", "D": "never closed"}, "answer": "A", "i": "q28zcwzuv74i"}, {"q": "Minor works charged to revenue", "options": {"A": "increase capital-at-charge", "B": "are treated as working expenses", "C": "go to block account", "D": "need Parliament vote"}, "answer": "B", "i": "q1g2rjyrbpz"}, {"q": "Expenditure on a new bridge is recorded in", "options": {"A": "Deposit", "B": "Revenue account", "C": "Capital (block) account", "D": "Suspense"}, "answer": "C", "i": "q1i8fw7jlv5e"}, {"q": "The rate of dividend payable by Railways was recommended by", "options": {"A": "CAG", "B": "Finance Ministry alone", "C": "Railway Board", "D": "Railway Convention Committee"}, "answer": "D", "i": "q26rjb3p634s"}, {"q": "Losses on socially desirable but uneconomic services are borne by", "options": {"A": "revenue", "B": "loans", "C": "deposits", "D": "capital"}, "answer": "A", "i": "q1a33k8ghfqp"}, {"q": "Depreciation on railway assets is treated as", "options": {"A": "capital receipt", "B": "revenue charge", "C": "suspense item", "D": "deposit"}, "answer": "B", "i": "q1v1hz34d1ym"}, {"q": "Demands for Grants relating to working expenses authorise", "options": {"A": "deposits", "B": "capital works", "C": "revenue expenditure", "D": "loans"}, "answer": "C", "i": "q1iqcikt5mi3"}, {"q": "Over-capitalisation of Railways means", "options": {"A": "revenue deficit", "B": "suspense accumulation", "C": "too little capital", "D": "excessive capital relative to earning capacity"}, "answer": "D", "i": "q1zto7ug756b"}, {"q": "The productivity of capital expenditure is judged by", "options": {"A": "return on capital invested", "B": "number of trains", "C": "track length", "D": "total staff"}, "answer": "A", "i": "q5p7jt5ezkb"}, {"q": "An incomplete new line at year-end is shown as", "options": {"A": "revenue", "B": "capital work in progress", "C": "suspense", "D": "deposit"}, "answer": "B", "i": "q100p0y3mov4"}, {"q": "Working expenses of the year are", "options": {"A": "deferred", "B": "capitalised", "C": "charged to the year's revenue", "D": "kept in suspense"}, "answer": "C", "i": "qldimtb9d4m"}, {"q": "A fundamental rule of railway finance is to", "options": {"A": "charge all to revenue", "B": "charge all to capital", "C": "merge them", "D": "keep them strictly separate"}, "answer": "D", "i": "q1waua57rqtb"}, {"q": "Charging capital expenditure to revenue results in", "options": {"A": "wrong surplus and wrong capital-at-charge", "B": "only audit objection", "C": "higher dividend", "D": "no effect"}, "answer": "A", "i": "q1rdy4q5kxhs"}, {"q": "Dividend to General Revenues was calculated on", "options": {"A": "gross earnings", "B": "capital-at-charge", "C": "net revenue", "D": "working expenses"}, "answer": "B", "i": "q1hb3aib6j7q"}, {"q": "The Development Fund is built up by", "options": {"A": "staff contributions", "B": "loans", "C": "appropriation from revenue surplus", "D": "traffic earnings directly"}, "answer": "C", "i": "q1os8a5o0yri"}, {"q": "The Depreciation Reserve Fund is fed by", "options": {"A": "loans", "B": "deposits", "C": "capital receipts", "D": "annual charge on revenue"}, "answer": "D", "i": "q2g7lu662a9z"}, {"q": "A new capital work requires", "options": {"A": "capital sanction with budget provision", "B": "no sanction", "C": "suspense sanction", "D": "revenue sanction"}, "answer": "A", "i": "q1vm8m50umyb"}, {"q": "Revenue surplus arises when", "options": {"A": "capital-at-charge", "B": "excess of receipts over working expenses", "C": "budget grant", "D": "loan amount"}, "answer": "B", "i": "q29as9n83apu"}, {"q": "Sale proceeds of scrap from a dismantled asset are credited to", "options": {"A": "deposit", "B": "revenue account", "C": "capital account", "D": "suspense"}, "answer": "C", "i": "q1i85e74w9ct"}]